            j "要我帮您把手擦干净吗？"
            $ juna_damsel = 1
            jump cleo6juna2
        "{color=#ffff00}揍他{/color}":
            y "让他见识见识[tribe_name]式的待客之道。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_18
            with dissolve
            j "我只喜欢强男人。"
            j "你觉得挨我这个老太婆一下？"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_19
            with dissolve
            runt "从一个尖耳朵的婊子手里？哈！当然。"
            runt "放马过来吧。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_20
            with vpunch
            runt "哈！？"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_21
            with vpunch
            runt "哎哟！"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_22
            with dissolve
            runt "操！你这精灵乡下的臭婊子！"
            runt "反正你们都是些怪胎！部族狗生的东西！"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_23
            with dissolve
            j "搞清楚自己的身份，平民。你不配和我们的王子踩在同一片土地上。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_24
            with dissolve
            runt "该死的精灵……"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_25
            with dissolve
            "流浪汉吓得逃走了。"
            j "努比利亚的懦夫。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_26
            with dissolve
            y "我们现在可是努比利亚人，别忘了。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_27
            with dissolve
            j "抱歉。我不是有意的，主人。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_28
            with dissolve
            y "没关系。"

            $ juna_fighter = 1
            jump cleo6juna
        "{color=#ffff00}戏弄他{/color}":
            y "去吧。告诉他你的主人是怎么待你的。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_35
            with dissolve
            j "我的主人待我很好。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_34
            with dissolve
            runt "不过不会比我待你好，漂亮宝贝！"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_36
            with dissolve
            j "他那根大鸡巴我都已经受不了了……"
            runt "*TSK* 精灵，你没见过大鸡巴，等你见过我的再说。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_39
            with dissolve
            j "是吗？昨晚我的主人从月亮升起一直操到日出。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_35
            with dissolve
            j "光是想想他的鸡巴我就湿得不行……"
            runt "你这个淫荡的婊子。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_37
            with dissolve
            j "主人，你要是想上，我随时都可以。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_38
            with dissolve
            runt "该死。真让人羡慕。"
            scene bg black
            show cleo6juna_29
            with dissolve
            "流浪汉溜走了。"
            $ juna_slut = 1
            jump cleo6juna
