    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_32
    with dissolve
    j "谢谢您，主人。我们之后能不能作为奖励，翻云覆雨一番？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_31
    with dissolve
    y "我向来乐意奖励勤勉的仆人。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_33
    jump cleoscene6menu
