    with dissolve
    y "听起来是个绝妙的主意。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_15
    with dissolve
    y "问题是，我已经和我面前这位漂亮精灵来过一次了。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_16
    with dissolve
    j "确实。下次再来就不会有最初的新鲜感了。非常抱歉，主人。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_17
    with dissolve
    j "也许城里别的地方更好？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_12
    with dissolve
    y "我没开玩笑，茱娜。这里很美。我肯定还会再来。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo6juna_13
    with dissolve
