label cleo8_admiral:
    menu:
        "我该问海军上将些什么呢……"
        "您当初为什么离开努比利亚？" if admiralLeaves == 0:
            $ admiralLeaves = 1
            jump admiralLeaves
        "那里是什么样的？" if admiralEmotion == 0:
            $ admiralEmotion = 1
            jump admiralEmotion
        "您为什么又回来？" if admiralWork == 0:
            $ admiralWork = 1
            jump admiralWork
        "我没有别的问题了":
            jump cleo8_exit
label admiralLeaves:
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_72
    with dissolve
    y "那您当初为什么要离开努比利亚？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_71
    with dissolve
    ad "唉，那时候我还年轻，丈夫刚刚去世。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_72
    with dissolve
    y "哦，对不起。我不知道这件事。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_73
    with dissolve
    ad "没关系，[player_name]！"
    ad "那大概是克莉奥出生一年以后的事。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_74
    with dissolve
    ad "当时我们做鱼货生意，我想重新开始。"
    ad "我招了几个志同道合的水手，越过海岸往外走，去贩卖珍稀的鱼。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_73
    with dissolve
    ad "慢慢地我也攒起了相当的名声，还组起了一支小船队。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_72
    with dissolve
    y "您为什么回到努比利亚？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_76
    with dissolve
    ad "..."
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_77
    with dissolve
    c "大概十五年前，妈妈接到了一批努比利亚商人的委托。"
    c "她回来接下这桩委托，对方就让她当上了渔船队的上将。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_78
    with dissolve
    ad "正是。"
    ad "那条件我没法拒绝。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_80
    with dissolve
    y "所以十五年前您就在努比利亚大陆上了？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_79
    with dissolve
    ad "是的。怎么了？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_80
    with dissolve
    y "父亲说您那时还在海上。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_79
    with dissolve
    ad "我确实还在沿岸跑商打鱼，所以你父亲会那么想也正常。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_80
    with dissolve
    jump cleo8_admiral
label admiralEmotion:
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_84
    with dissolve
    y "那里是什么样的？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_84
    with dissolve
    ad "是路上的过程，还是目的地？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_84
    with dissolve
    y "两者都有一点。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_85
    with dissolve
    ad "好吧。"
    ad "那个过程很痛苦。"
    ad "……我们失去了很多，但也为自己建立了新的生活。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_86
    with dissolve
    ad "那些岛很美，可我要是不去，就永远不会……"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_85
    with dissolve
    ad "……也就不会创下如今这样的名声。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_84
    with dissolve
    y "值得吗？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_87
    with dissolve
    ad "..."
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_88
    with dissolve
    ad "怎么会不值得？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_89
    with dissolve
    ad "现在我有了女儿、船队，也许还会多个女婿。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_90
    with dissolve
    ad "也许还会有个外孙？"
    c "妈！"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_91
    with dissolve
    ad "什么？"
    ad "说起来，你们两个上床了没有？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_90
    with dissolve
    c "妈！求您了！"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_82
    with dissolve
    ad "真叫人意外！"
    ad "我还以为我女儿会保守一点呢。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_79
    with dissolve
    ad "可是 [player_name]，我还真以为你是个小色狼！"
    ad "我还记得以前在苏什，你老在浴池里偷看我。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_82
    with dissolve
    y "海军上将！求您了！"
    c "住口！"
    ad "哈哈哈哈哈！"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_80
    with dissolve
    jump cleo8_admiral
label admiralWork:
    if admiralLeaves == 1:
        scene bg black
        show cleo8_86
        with dissolve
        ad "就像我刚说的，我从一批努比利亚商人那里接了一桩大买卖。"
    else:
        scene bg black
        show cleo8_86
        with dissolve
        ad "我从苏什的一批努比利亚商人那里接了一桩大买卖。"
    ad "他们答应给我一个议会席位。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_84
    with dissolve
    y "如果不介意我问一句，那到底是什么买卖？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_79
    with dissolve
    ad "抱歉啊小鬼。这笔交易的条件之一就是保密。"
    ad "我只跟你说这些，是因为你差不多算自家人了，但每个细枝末节我还不能全抖出来。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_72
    with dissolve
    y "我明白了。"
    y "在粉碎岛待五年就肯走，这笔买卖肯定很划算。"
    y "所以我只是想问问。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_74
    with dissolve
    ad "你记错了，我们在岛上待了八年。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_76
    with dissolve
    y "真的吗？克莉奥，我记得你说的是五年。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_77
    with dissolve
    c "是吗？那一定是我记错了，那时我还小。"
    c "不过，十五年前的事谁还在意？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_78
    with dissolve
    ad "说得对，我美丽的小珍珠，聊点别的吧。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_80
    with dissolve
    y "好的。"
    jump cleo8_admiral
label cleo8_exit:
    "你们三个都起来。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_93
    with dissolve
    ad "过去的事就到此为止吧。"
    ad "我们来聊聊未来吧！"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_94
    with dissolve
    c "我知道你要说什么了，拜托别说了。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_96
    with dissolve
    ad "得了吧！你俩从一开始就形影不离。"
    ad "还记得你们以前在浴池外面互相等着吗？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_95
    with dissolve
    c "我敢肯定 [player_name] 只是在等着偷看。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_97
    with dissolve
    ad "那又怎么了？"
    y "对啊，那又怎么了？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_98
    with dissolve
    ad "男生本来就是变态，这不是他的错。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_99
    with dissolve
    y "你、你说什——什么？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_100
    with dissolve
    ad "有这种健康的需求挺好的。"
    ad "那今晚谁去给他暖床？"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_102
    with dissolve
    c "给他暖床的人可多了去了。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_103
    with dissolve
    c "角蟾。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_104
    with dissolve
    ad "[player_name]，我在学院过一夜，你不介意吧？"
    ad "我可以回船上，不过还是想去活动活动筋骨。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_105
    with dissolve
    y "您当然可以留下。随时都欢迎您，海军上将诺提卡。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_106
    with dissolve
    ad "多谢您。"
    scene bg black
    show cleo8_107
    with dissolve
    ad "带我去你的房间吧，亲爱的。"
    scene bg black
    with fade
    "克莉奥和她母亲往她的房间走去。"
    y "（自从来到努比利亚，我还没经历过这么尴尬的对话。）"
    y "（克莉奥怎么会知道有没有人进过我的房间？）"
    y "（也许多跟人待一会儿，我就能弄明白了）"
    $ renpy.end_replay()
    jump mainend
label cleoscene9:
    $ lovecleo = 9
    scene bg black
    show luceroom10
    with dissolve
    lu "哦……"
    lu "好的。"
    scene bg black
    with fade
    "你和露丝脱下衣服。"
    scene bg black
    show luce_BJ1
    with dissolve
    "你看着她四肢着地爬向你。"
    scene bg black
    show luce_BJ22
    with dissolve
    "你用余光瞥到有人……"
    scene bg black
    show luce_BJ23
    with dissolve
    "是克莉奥！"
    y "（我就知道。那丫头就是个偷窥狂……）"
    scene bg black
    show luce_BJ24
    with vpunch
    c "!"
    scene bg black
    show luce_BJ25
    with dissolve
    "克莉奥一发现你在看她，就跑掉了。"
    scene bg black
    show luce_BJ6
    with dissolve
    "你回头一看，露丝正在研究你的「兄弟」……"
    menu:
        "要看这一幕吗？"
        "观看场景":
            scene bg black
            show luceroomBJ1
            with dissolve
            "露丝用双唇裹住你的鸡巴。"
            lu "咕噜——唔嗯~"
            lu "唔嗯~ 呃呃……"
            y "你做得很好。"
            y "你简直像是天生就该舔我的鸡巴。"
            lu "唔嗯！"
            "露丝抗议地吸吮着……"
            scene bg black
            show luceroomBJ2
            with dissolve
            "随着她的舌头探索着你肉棒的顶端，动作越来越激烈。"
            "她一边上下吞吐着你的鸡巴，舌头一边顺着你的长度拖曳。"
            lu "呃呃……{w}唔呃……"
            y "哦 耶……{w}太棒了。"
            "露丝把你的话放在心上，把更多的鸡巴含进嘴里。"
            "没过多久，那种熟悉的感觉就开始涌上来……"
            scene bg black
            show luce_BJ17
            with dissolve
            lu "呃啊！"
            scene bg black
            show luce_BJ15
            with vpunch
            lu "啊——呃啊——唔、唔嗯！？"
            "露丝似乎意识到后想退开，却又停住了。"
            scene bg black
            show luce_BJ16
            with vpunch
            "然后她突然低下头，把你的鸡巴更深地吞进嘴里。"
            lu "唔嗯……"
            "你感觉到她的喉咙随着你射精而一阵阵收缩。"
            scene bg black
            show luce_BJ18
            with dissolve
            "她慢慢把嘴松开。"
            scene bg black
            show luce_BJ19
            with dissolve
            lu "..."
            scene bg black
            show luce_BJ20
            with dissolve
            lu "满意了吗？"
            scene bg black
            show luce_BJ21
            with dissolve
            y "很满意。"
            scene bg black
            with fade
            "两人穿好衣服，收拾干净。"
            scene bg black
            show luceroom7
            with dissolve
            lu "今晚就到这里吗？"
            y "是的，可以说结束了。"
            scene bg black
            show luceroom10
            with dissolve
            lu "好吧……{w}晚、晚安，[player_name]。"
            y "晚安，露丝。"
            "露丝自行告退，回到自己的房间。"
            scene bg black
            with fade
            $ renpy.end_replay()
            jump mainend
        "跳过场景":
            "和露丝度过了一个愉快的夜晚后，她回自己房间了。"
            scene bg black
            with fade
            $ renpy.end_replay()
            jump mainend
label cleoscene10:
    $ lovecleo = 10
