    amy0 "干得不错，护卫。"
    scene bg black
    show marion2_52
    with dissolve
    amy0 "那个黑皮女巫把你拴得挺紧的吧。"
    scene bg black
    show marion2_53
    with dissolve
    y "（黑皮女巫，蕾娅？）"
    scene bg black
    show marion2_56
    with dissolve
    amy0 "真是个泼妇。{w}[player_name]大人，您可以替我转告她。"
    scene bg black
    show marion2_57
    with dissolve
    y "哦……{w}原来您知道？"
    scene bg black
    show marion2_63
    with dissolve
    amy0 "您的演技可不算老练。"
    scene bg black
